---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
---
<Base title="Built Signal">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Ben Davis Builds / Built Signal</p><h1>A place to<br />think.<br /><em>A place to build.</em></h1><p class="lead">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. A preview of a home for ideas, experiments, and thoughtful conversations.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="/writing/">Explore sample writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button" href="/projects/">View sample projects</a></div><p class="hero-caption">A development template. Real stories will come later.</p></div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="horizon-label">BUILT SIGNAL<span>IDEAS / SYSTEMS / PEOPLE</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 480 520" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"><path class="horizon-far" d="M0 340 60 270 95 295 175 170 230 245 285 215 375 300 430 250 480 310V520H0Z"/><path class="horizon-middle" d="M0 400 75 350 150 400 240 300 295 360 365 335 480 410V520H0Z"/><path class="horizon-near" d="M0 480 80 440 165 465 240 390 300 420 370 395 480 460V520H0Z"/><path class="horizon-detail" d="M175 170 190 218 230 245M240 300 250 348 295 360"/></svg><div class="art-caption">An illustrative horizon.<br />No borrowed story.</div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Explore the template</p><h2>Small beginnings.<br />Room for useful things.</h2></div><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Three places to begin.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><Card title="Notes worth returning to" description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet. A quiet, readable space for sample writing." href="/writing/sample/" label="Writing / sample"/><Card title="Ideas taking shape" description="Consectetur adipiscing elit. A simple project template, without invented outcomes." href="/projects/" label="Projects / sample"/><Card title="A clearer conversation" description="Integer posuere erat a ante. A placeholder for future mentorship content." href="/mentorship/" label="Mentorship / sample"/></div></section>
  <section class="closing-panel"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Behind the template</p><h2>Curiosity is a good<br />place to start.</h2><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. The about page is waiting for a real story.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Visit the sample about page <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
</Base>
